Package: joy-pi-health
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Adrien_hue <adrien.houee1@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.60), systemd (>= 254)@ACL_DEPENDS@
Description: lightweight Raspberry Pi host health service
 Joy Pi Health exposes a bounded HTTP/JSON snapshot of Raspberry Pi host
 resources and platform health. It runs as an unprivileged foreground service.

